# ============================================================
# Workspace — manage OpenCode workspaces.
# Docs: https://opencode.ai/v2/docs/api
# ============================================================


### Create workspace
POST {{BASE_URL}}/api/workspace
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "path": "/path/to/workspace",
  "title": "My workspace"
}

### Destroy workspace
DELETE {{BASE_URL}}/api/workspace/{{workspaceID}}
